{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Your First Day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/ea6c88b911c98396712c126f00f557c2.poster.avif?t=1764330402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/ea6c88b911c98396712c126f00f557c2.webm?t=1764330402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/ea6c88b911c98396712c126f00f557c2.mp4?t=1764330402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a janitor in a secret underground facility, guided by ANNA, an AI with a childlike voice. Your job: clean biological waste and worse. Every task is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/d2391229de1e7ec4d42a6155028b642b.poster.avif?t=1764330402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/d2391229de1e7ec4d42a6155028b642b.webm?t=1764330402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/d2391229de1e7ec4d42a6155028b642b.mp4?t=1764330402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides a unique, immortal entity that wants you dead. Some stalk silently; others attack without warning. Hide, run, and clean\u2014or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Dread</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/33d301868ca4243f5e3fb467614d918e.poster.avif?t=1764330402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/33d301868ca4243f5e3fb467614d918e.webm?t=1764330402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/33d301868ca4243f5e3fb467614d918e.mp4?t=1764330402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility\u2019s cold, illogical design amplifies your loneliness. Inspired by Control and SCP, every corner holds surreal horror. Will you survive your shift?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/0a69d692aee6e41cf4de6f1733e28ecf.poster.avif?t=1764330402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/0a69d692aee6e41cf4de6f1733e28ecf.webm?t=1764330402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/extras/0a69d692aee6e41cf4de6f1733e28ecf.mp4?t=1764330402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042150?t=1764330402","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/6434664dbcbc16bf6c135f12b043538ea2d063a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764330402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042150/a307fd2db1c513c4d06f1aad35b938df8d97a8fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764330402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st